-- title:
--   Potential-table certificate data, intervals 64–127
-- statement:
--   The concrete rational data for the 64 consecutive intervals numbered 64 through 127 in the 684-cell potential certificate. The records contain the component log bounds, root enclosures, external-field bounds, and interval positions, arranged as a balanced finite table.
--
--   The associated validity theorem checks these data by exact rational arithmetic. Together with the generic soundness theorem, it certifies the potential inequality over this portion of the short segment.
--
--   **Formalization Note** The module and its dependencies import no Mathlib modules.
-- source:
